(6853770, 1030171, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular.  The details are mesmerizing and the contrast is beautiful.  Congrats on your first ribbon!</td>', 'This is spectacular.  The details are mesmerizing and the contrast is beautiful.  Congrats on your first ribbon!', '2012-09-01 10:18:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6854149, 1030617, 43463, '<td valign="top">A belated congrats on the top ten placement! Love all the great and wonderful details seen in this spiral shell. Lighting on the subject is superb!</td>', 'A belated congrats on the top ten placement! Love all the great and wonderful details seen in this spiral shell. Lighting on the subject is superb!', '2012-09-02 01:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6854580, 1030576, 1031, '<td valign="top">Your version certainly fared better than mine, possibly the smaller structure of the flowers  congratulations!<br/> <br/>Thanks you for the explanation of the Fibonacci spiral -- I''ve been wondering about how that worked for a while.</td>', 'Your version certainly fared better than mine, possibly the smaller structure of the flowers  congratulations! Thanks you for the explanation of the Fibonacci spiral -- I''ve been wondering about how that worked for a while.', '2012-09-02 18:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6855230, 1030393, 103142, '<td valign="top">Way to go on the PB!! What a great find and capture!</td>', 'Way to go on the PB!! What a great find and capture!', '2012-09-03 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6856079, 1030648, 117474, '<td valign="top">Sorry for late notice, but you got the asigmatic:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1000203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif"/></a></td>', 'Sorry for late notice, but you got the asigmatic:', '2012-09-04 13:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6859868, 1030259, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I think the choice of subject was perfect for this challenge and I love the choice to use black and white.  I suspect it is a bit disappointing to get a low score for this, as it does meet the challenge topic pretty well.<br/> <br/>Sadly, I think some technical issues are letting you down with this image.<br/> <br/>Composition:  Nothing really wrong with the composition, but it''s possible that it could benefit from having a little bit more of the background surrounding the subject.  The bottom edge, the cauliflower is very close to the edge of the frame.  <br/> <br/>Exposure:  To my eye (and when checking the histogram) the image feels a little bit underexposed.  I think a very minor adjustment to levels or curves would bring some life into the image and yet still retain the low key look that was clearly what you were aiming for.<br/> <br/>Focus:  This is one of those images where the focus needs to be spot on.  In this image the focus really is a little bit off.  you make no mention of using a tripod or another form of stabilisation.  1/8 of a second is a bit on the slow side to get a sharp image.  <br/> <br/>It''s such a pity about the focus, for I''m certain if this image was sharp, it would have scored at least 1 full point higher than it did.  <br/> <br/>I noticed you have joined DPC quite recently, so don''t let this one put you off.  Keep entering and welcome to DPC.<br/> <br/>Sarah</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club I think the choice of subject was perfect for this challenge and I love the choice to use black and white.  I suspect it is a bit disappointing to get a low score for this, as it does meet the challenge topic pretty well. Sadly, I think some technical issues are letting you down with this image. Composition:  Nothing really wrong with the composition, but it''s possible that it could benefit from having a little bit more of the background surrounding the subject.  The bottom edge, the cauliflower is very close to the edge of the frame.   Exposure:  To my eye (and when checking the histogram) the image feels a little bit underexposed.  I think a very minor adjustment to levels or curves would bring some life into the image and yet still retain the low key look that was clearly what you were aiming for. Focus:  This is one of those images where the focus needs to be spot on.  In this image the focus really is a little bit off.  you make no mention of using a tripod or another form of stabilisation.  1/8 of a second is a bit on the slow side to get a sharp image.   It''s such a pity about the focus, for I''m certain if this image was sharp, it would have scored at least 1 full point higher than it did.   I noticed you have joined DPC quite recently, so don''t let this one put you off.  Keep entering and welcome to DPC. Sarah', '2012-09-08 03:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6928894, 1030614, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love that special place where green meets sharpened black/gray and you nailed it here.</td>', 'I love that special place where green meets sharpened black/gray and you nailed it here.', '2012-12-10 08:16:01.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
